{
 "about": "The player's launch filmed from outside the station (M8-T03, D81): the squadron-launch cinematic's last launch and the relaunch after a repair in the main docking bay (M8-T06) use these phases instead of cobra_launch.json's (the launch's own steps and timings stay cobra_launch.json's). Same format: a phase plays 'at_s' into the player's step; actors 'bay' (the player's door, x across the arm, y out of the drum, z aft) and 'fighter' (the player's ship). Each variant's 'move' says the camera's move in one line (M8-T30, for the review sheets). No shot lasts 3 s or more (maintainer, 2026-11-19): between phases the director cuts to other shots of the pool, none twice in one launch while unplayed ones remain.",
